  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Creates a huge\nwave, then crashes\nit down on the foe.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ruby-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/5/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Creates a huge\nwave, then crashes\nit down on the foe.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A big wave crashes\ndown on the foe.\nCan also be used\nfor crossing water.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It swamps the entire battlefield with\na giant wave. It can also be used\nto cross water.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "diamond-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/8/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It swamps the entire battlefield with\na giant wave. It can also be used\nto cross water.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It swamps the entire battlefield with\na giant wave. It can also be used\nto cross water.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une énorme vague s’abat sur le\nchamp de bataille. Permet aussi\nde voyager sur l’eau.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It swamps the area around the user\nwith a giant wave.\nIt can also be used for crossing water.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It swamps the area around the user\nwith a giant wave.\nIt can also be used for crossing water.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "おおきな　なみで　じぶんの　まわりに\nいるものを　こうげきする。\nみずのうえを　すすむことも　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "큰 파도를 일으켜서 자신의\n주위에 있는 포켓몬을 공격한다.\n물 위를 나아갈 수도 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une énorme vague s’abat sur le champ de\nbataille. Permet aussi de voyager sur l’eau.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine riesige Flutwelle ergießt sich über das nähere\nUmfeld des Anwenders. Ermöglicht das Surfen auf\ndem Wasser.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se dice que esta cadena mítica está relacionada\ncon el Pokémon legendario que creó la región de\nSinnoh.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un’onda enorme sommerge il campo di lotta,\ncolpendo tutti i Pokémon intorno a chi la scatena.\nFuori dalla lotta si usa per spostarsi sull’acqua.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks everything around it by\nswamping its surroundings with a giant wave.\nThis can also be used for crossing water.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "大きな　波で　自分の　周りに\nいるものを　攻撃する。\n水上も　泳いで　進める。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
